Architecture Diagram

Author: SeaMc <sauthm_2015@qq.com>
Last Updated: November 7, 2026

====================

* BIOS => MBR - Master Boot Record
-  Set MBR flags;
-  Read and jump to next (0x7E00).

* MBR => TPM - To Protected Mode
-  Set TPM flags.
-  Into protected mode.
-  Read and jump to next (0x100000).

* TPM => TLM - To Long Mode
-  Set TLM flags.
-  Into long mode.
-  Halt.
